<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 28,000 MT were up 17 percent from the previous week, but 68 percent below the 4-week average.  Increases for Israel (17,900 MT), Mexico (15,600 MT), and Turkey (6,000 MT) were partly offset by reductions for unknown destinations (9,900 MT) and Japan (1,600 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 79,900 MT were down 42 percent from the prior week and one-third below the 4-week average.  Mexico (55,400 MT) was the major destination.</p>
</text>
